  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A spellcaster can mystically imprint spells into an Eberron dragonshard rather than physically writing them into a spellbook. A single spellshard is about the size of a human fist. The spellcaster can concentrate on the shard in order to bring any spell stored in it into focus; the spell appears as silvery writing within the swirling colours of the shard. Each Spellshard can hold up to 100 spells. The Price listed is for a blank Spellshard.</p>"
    },
